 to be a little too impulsive while Roseanne is quick tempered. Christmas gatherings are always an experience! This year, we  will be heading to the snow! <br><br>How impatient is Roseanne going to be on the slopes? How crazy are we?"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Introduce yourself and your family<br>\n<ul><li>What is your name?</li>\n<li>Who is part of your immediate and extended family?</li>\n<li>Do you have a blended family?</li></ul>"}], "video_src": "engenn6le01ob08re3vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}]}